          "kicker": "Captain's verdict",
          "heading": "Italy captain Nicotera rates Fiji more manageable, but warns of individual brilliance",
          "body": "Speaking to the media in his pre-match press conference, Italy hooker and captain Giacomo Nicotera said the world rankings reflect real gaps between sides. He also cautioned that Fiji remain a team to fear, pointing to their incredible individual talent and their players in France's Top 14. The Azzurri go into Saturday's Round 6 test still chasing a first win of the tournament after defeats to South Africa (7-66) and Argentina (14-19). Fiji arrive bottom of the log, beaten in all five matches, most recently 15-43 by Ireland."
