          "kicker": "Late change",
          "heading": "Concussed Sam Illo out as Thomas Clarkson joins Ireland bench against Springboks",
          "body": "Connacht tighthead prop Sam Illo failed to complete return-to-play protocols after the concussion he picked up in last week's 43-15 win over Fiji, forcing Ireland head coach Andy Farrell into a late change for Saturday's Nations Championship test against South Africa at the Aviva Stadium, SA Rugby Magazine reports. Leinster's Thomas Clarkson takes the No. 18 jersey and is in line for his first appearance of the championship's second leg, while Connacht's Finlay Bealham has joined the squad as emergency cover."
