          "kicker": "Captain's call",
          "heading": "Captain Giacomo Nicotera says Italy carry lingering frustration into Udine Fiji test",
          "body": "In his pre-match press conference, Italy captain Giacomo Nicotera said the side could not be satisfied with the 14-19 Round 5 defeat to Argentina. He added that they want to show they are the Italy capable of great feats rather than the team of recent weeks. The Trieste native called Fiji, Saturday's visitors to Udine, more beatable, in line with the world rankings, but still a side to fear for their individual talent. He also said debutant fly-half Domingo Miotti had settled in very well."
        },
