          "kicker": "Captaincy change",
          "heading": "Rory Darge's shoulder injury hands Stafford McDowall the Scotland captaincy against Japan",
          "body": "Glasgow Warriors openside Rory Darge, man of the match against Australia, was initially named to start despite a shoulder injury, but after further assessment he will sit out the Japan test at Murrayfield. It is head coach Gregor Townsend's second change of captain in a week, after Sione Tuipulotu was ruled out. Centre Stafford McDowall, called in from his father's farm in Dumfries to come off the bench against the Wallabies, takes the armband. Matt Fagerson starts at No. 8, with Ollie Leatherbarrow moving to openside."
        },
