          "kicker": "Back-row return",
          "heading": "Facundo Isa handed Pumas No. 8 shirt for first start since 2025",
          "body": "Argentina head coach Felipe Contepomi has promoted the Pau No. 8 from the bench in Genoa to start Saturday's test against France. It is one of seven changes that restore Julián Montoya as captain and Tomás Lavanini to the second row. Isa, who put his international career on hold in 2023, last started for the Pumas in July 2025's defeat to England. He has started seven of nine club matches this season, including a brace against Toulouse on 1 November. Club coach Sébastien Piqueronies notes he is out of contract."
