          "body": "Keijiro Tamafusa and Opeti Helu are both missing from Japan's front row for Saturday's Nations Championship test against Scotland, Rugby Asia 247 reports, with Shuhei Takeuchi and Riku Tokito also absent through injury or conditioning. Toyota Verblitz's Taufa Latu is among the call-ups. It is a thin hand to bring to Murrayfield after the 78-15 hammering by England, against a Scotland side who edged Australia 15-12 last weekend and have won eight of nine previous meetings."
